  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "The envelope (D32)",
      "items": [
        "A JSON object in the payload carries key, stamp and exit; anything else is a reading of its text",
        "A reading with no at is stamped with the receive time and says stamped_by: receiver",
        "MQTT v5 properties were rejected: only a 3.1.1 broker can be proven here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Three slots, one lock",
      "items": [
        "A sensor filter keeps only the latest message; staleness is data via age_seconds",
        "A witness filter queues every message; one is handed over per invoke",
        "An ack is matched to the act in flight by (ack_topic, key) \u2014 an ack for another key is not ours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Known gaps",
      "items": [
        "The witness queue is unbounded \u2014 TD-002",
        "A wildcard sensor cannot say which concrete topic it read \u2014 ENH-001",
        "Registration mutates the filter sets outside the lock the router iterates under \u2014 BUG-003"
      ]
    }
  ]
